 *     - Reporter_member_id matches the member who filed it
 *     - Status is 'pending', 'under_review', or business default
 *     - Content type/category/reason fields match submission
 *     - All IDs are present and correctly linked
 * 7. Optionally check that report timestamps are recent (not required, but good audit hygiene)
