 *
 * This test verifies both the successful and failed retrieval of a notification using the admin notifications detail API. 
 * 
 * Business context:
 * - Only the intended admin recipient (by admin_id) can access the detail of the notification.
 * - System must enforce role and ownership boundaries. Other users, even admins, are not permitted access to notifications not addressed to them.
 *
