 * time range filtering, and optionally including soft-deleted entries. Categories are created
 * with diverse names, creation and update timestamps, and one is soft-deleted by simulating
 * the business logic. Filtered search scenarios are run to ensure filter parameters are
 * respected and results match expectations.
 *
 * Steps:
 * 1. Create several categories with unique and semi-overlapping names and varying timestamps.
 * 2. Search with exact and partial name filters and verify returned categories match filter.
 * 3. Search using pagination and verify correct page sizes/content.
 * 4. Simulate soft-delete by creating a category with deleted_at, then filter with and without inclusion of deleted categories.
