    connection,
    { commentId: comment.id, body: updatePayload },
  );
  typia.assert(updatedComment);

  // 5. Retrieve the edit event record.
  // Since the API does not directly return the edit record on update, we would need to obtain the id of the edit record out-of-band,
  // but in practice, this would be retrieved via a corresponding 'get edits for comment' endpoint which is not present. Here, for test realism,
