 * - The endpoint /discussionBoard/guest/notificationSettings allows guests to
 *   query their own notification settings with filtering.
 * - The privacy requirements dictate that a guest user should NOT be able to
 *   retrieve notification settings for any user except their own guest
 *   session.
 * - The API must enforce Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) and prevent information
 *   disclosure.
 *
 * Test steps:
