 *    new post.
 * 5. Attempt to delete the post-tag association as the author.
 * 6. (For verification) Check that the tag is no longer associated with the post
 *    (by successfully re-adding it, confirming the new association differs from
 *    the erased one).
 *
 * Note: Sequence switches from member (for registration/posting) to admin (for
 * tag creation) and back to member for tag assignment and removal actions. If
 * separate authentication or connection objects were provided for admin/member,
 * those would be used at the relevant steps.
 */
export async function test_api_discussionBoard_test_remove_post_tag_as_post_author_with_valid_permissions(
